{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56504","headline":"传付心诀再歌 · 岑真人","name":"传付心诀再歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水神投金碧，乾坤日月精。\n坎离爲既济，三才显其名。\n阳数居阴杀，阴数归阳刑。\n欲知颠倒术，相尅是相生。\n若修诸八石，千万无一成。\n欲觅真道者，壬癸上寻庚。\n（《大还丹照监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}